  <Properties>
    <Name>The Freehold of Una Court</Name>
    <Teaser>Seven Trent civilizations: possession, loyal companions, serenades, library exile, and phone theft.</Teaser>
    <Description>Seven Community Patch civilizations: Freehold, Dominion, Ultimate Possession, Soft Kitty Serenader, Library Exile, the espionage-focused Phone Stealer, and the Pupil of Two Masters Princedom.</Description>
